## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
**Part A — Why This Company Can Compound:**  
Customer acquisition → high switching costs → recurring revenue streams → reinvested in innovation and marketing → stronger market position.  

ADP’s sticky HR solutions create a virtuous cycle of customer retention and revenue growth, supported by consistent R&D investment (4.8% of revenue).  

